5. Visual assets and other excluded material
--------------------------------------------
The CC BY-SA manuscript license and MIT code license do not automatically
cover visual assets, logos, favicons, maps, illustrations, commissioned work,
or system fonts. ASSET_PROVENANCE.md identifies the current visual files and
their clearance state. An asset without documented provenance and reuse terms
must be treated as development-only and not cleared for commercial release or
downstream reuse.

